    "Id": "vehiclechassisdef_Igor_LGauss_CASE",
    "Name": "Igor Heavy Lifter",
    "Details": "Ubiquitous across the Inner Sphere, the Igor is a name given to a generic super heavy lift platform. Originally developed to rapidly relocate heavy armor under battlefield conditions, the design has since spawned a host of imitators and copy cats with almost every developed world in the Inner Sphere and the Periphery possessing at least one Igor or Igor derived clone. An FWL combat model of the 60 ton VTOL, the Igor (L-Gauss) mounts a pair of Light Gauss Rifles and a C3 Slave unit, complemented by three tons of additional ordnance on the wings.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 7/11 hexes / 210/330 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Heavy Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       175     30\n<b>Left</b>         125     30\n<b>Right</b>       125     30\n<b>Rear</b>        100     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      550    150</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Rugged</color>",
    "Icon": "RedKite"
  },
